# 0178 (SwordMan): the code generator options of mgr-nx-deko (third_party/mgr-nx-deko/patches/rexglue-sdk-v0.10.0.patch,
# only src/codegen, include/rex/codegen, include/rex/ppc and resources/templates/codegen). Every option is off by
# default; mgr_codegen.toml turns them on one at a time. GPL-3.0 (the port), BSD-3-Clause (the SDK).

